# Business Problem

In the e-commerce industry, customer satisfaction depends heavily on reliable and timely order delivery. Delayed shipments, inconsistent shipping performance, and limited visibility into delivery operations can negatively impact customer experience and business performance.

The available shipping data contains valuable information about customers, products, shipping methods, discounts, customer ratings, and delivery outcomes. However, raw operational data alone does not provide the meaningful information needed to monitor performance, identify trends, or support business decisions.

The objective of this project is to transform the raw shipping data into reliable, business-ready information that enables business users to monitor shipping performance, analyze delivery outcomes, understand customer behavior, and identify opportunities to improve operational efficiency.
